@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 JavaScript string literals with escaped line breaks, two and three lines long, under the default and trailingComma all (tests/format/js/strings/multiline-literal.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 Flow string literal types with escaped line breaks (tests/format/flow/literal/multiline.js) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 TypeScript string literal types with escaped line breaks (tests/format/typescript/literal/multiline.ts) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Print the line breaks inside a printed string as literal lines, so the doc printer measures only the first line (src/common/util.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Add the changelog entry (changelog_unreleased/javascript/13274.md)
